    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138840/extras/71994aa06a0a1fbd928cec72c801c61c.poster.avif?t=1725462162\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138840/extras/71994aa06a0a1fbd928cec72c801c61c.webm?t=1725462162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138840/extras/71994aa06a0a1fbd928cec72c801c61c.mp4?t=1725462162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Will you be able to manage this bunch of lazy and good for nothing people?</strong><br><br>Island Survival: Escape from Paradise is a casual and strategy 3D game where you will need to help a group of castaways escape from a tropical island. To do this, you must assign them tasks such as gathering water and food or building a boat. The problem is that each one will have their own skills and preferences, so they might refuse to do a task they don't like, or cause an accident trying to do something they're bad at.<br><br>It's your job to discover and remember the hobbies and skills of your castaways in order to assign them the most appropriate tasks.",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138840/extras/71994aa06a0a1fbd928cec72c801c61c.poster.avif?t=1725462162\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138840/extras/71994aa06a0a1fbd928cec72c801c61c.webm?t=1725462162\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3138840/extras/71994aa06a0a1fbd928cec72c801c61c.mp4?t=1725462162\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Will you be able to manage this bunch of lazy and good for nothing people?</strong><br><br>Island Survival: Escape from Paradise is a casual and strategy 3D game where you will need to help a group of castaways escape from a tropical island. To do this, you must assign them tasks such as gathering water and food or building a boat. The problem is that each one will have their own skills and preferences, so they might refuse to do a task they don't like, or cause an accident trying to do something they're bad at.<br><br>It's your job to discover and remember the hobbies and skills of your castaways in order to assign them the most appropriate tasks.",
